# Python AI worker

- No PostgreSQL credentials. No domain writes.
- Pydantic validate all ingress/egress CloudEvents and tool I/O.
- Strands coordinates tools/models inside a job; LiteLLM SDK is the model boundary.
- Tenacity retries only classified transient failures.
- Tools: allowlisted, sized, timed, telemetried; treat retrieved text as untrusted.
- Business code uses model aliases (`research.standard`, `review.strict`) — mapping in settings.
- Versioned prompt templates as assets; enforce token/cost budgets per job type.
- Publish typed results only; never apply model JSON as a domain command.
- structlog + OTEL; redact prompts/secrets by default.
